flowchart TD
    start([Employer opens the site]) --> load[Site reads projects.json]
    load --> ok{Could the file be read?}
    ok -- no --> error[/Shows: Could not load projects/]
    ok -- yes --> list[/Shows one card per project, in the order of the file: title, short description, tech/]
    list --> image{Does the project have an image?}
    image -- yes --> picture[/The card shows the image/]
    image -- no --> placeholder[/The card shows a placeholder/]
    picture --> pick[/Employer clicks a project/]
    placeholder --> pick
    pick --> page[/Project page: full description, what I learned, tech, link to the repo/]
    page --> demo{Does the project have a demo address?}
    demo -- yes --> button[/Shows a Live demo button/]
    demo -- no --> nobutton[/No demo button/]
    button --> leave([Employer opens the demo or the repo on GitHub])
    nobutton --> leave
